# Use Cases & UI

## Screens

**Design approach:** sketch

- Create habit
- Sign in

## Build order

1. create habit (uc1)
2. check in habit (uc2)
3. set a reminder (uc3)

## Use cases

### uc1 — create habit

**Actor:** Member

**Happy path**

| Step | Actor | Action |
| --- | --- | --- |
| 1 | user | taps New Habit and enters a name |
| 2 | system | validates the name |
| 3 | database | stores the new habit |
| 4 | user | sees the habit in their list |

**Failure paths**

| Trigger | System response | What the user sees |
| --- | --- | --- |
| duplicate name | reject the duplicate | a message that the habit already exists |
| empty name | block the save | a validation error asking for a name |

### uc2 — check in habit

**Actor:** Member

**Happy path**

| Step | Actor | Action |
| --- | --- | --- |
| 1 | user | opens a habit and taps Done for today |
| 2 | system | records the check-in |
| 3 | database | saves the check-in |

**Failure paths**

| Trigger | System response | What the user sees |
| --- | --- | --- |
| double check-in | ignore the second check-in | the habit shown as already done today |
| offline | queue the check-in and sync later | a note that it will sync when back online |

### uc3 — set a reminder

**Actor:** Member

**Happy path**

| Step | Actor | Action |
| --- | --- | --- |
| 1 | user | opens a habit and sets a reminder time |
| 2 | system | schedules the reminder |
| 3 | external | sends a notification at the set time |

**Failure paths**

| Trigger | System response | What the user sees |
| --- | --- | --- |
| notification fails | retry once, then log it | nothing — the reminder is best-effort |
| past time | schedule it for the next day | a note that the reminder starts tomorrow |
"
